                                "sense_id": "ba6caf0c-1a55-3527-b0e5-80581391ed1f",
                                "text": "“Isn't their daughter named Melanie?”\n“Mellie, for short,” Ken confirmed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "df4ef18d-8b03-40db-99c5-bfe2b83a182d",
                                "sense_id": "ba6caf0c-1a55-3527-b0e5-80581391ed1f",
                                "text": "“When I married him he was forty,” said Mellie, “and he owned a sleeping bag, a rifle, and a suitcase with a change of clothes.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ee2ac640-8670-38c5-8bfa-045f6f8c7b84",
